    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d654">

                <pb facs="0811" n="717" xml:id="pg717"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Williams to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-05-07"><hi rendition="#italic">May 7,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have received 5 o’clock p.m. from admiral commanding the answer to my
                    communication of the 30th in regard to the American citizens captured on <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Competitor</hi>. He replies seventh article of the
                    treaty 1795 and the protocol do not apply to them as they are not residents in
                    accordance with law relating to foreigners and they are to be tried by summary
                    court martial. I am preparing answer and protest in accordance with your
                    telegram 2d instant.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
